  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.38 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Facilities and Professions Regulated by the N.H. Pharmacy Board. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.38, below, shall apply to the facilities and professions regulated the N.H. pharmacy board under RSA 318:\n\nTable 1002.38 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Facilities and Professions Regulated by the N.H. Pharmacy Board\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nPharmacist license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $275\n\nPharmacist, pharmacy intern, advanced pharmacy technician, or certified pharmacy technician immunization endorsement application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of endorsement | attached to license | $27\n\nPharmacy technician registration or certification application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of registration or certification | 2 years | $110\n\nPharmacy intern license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial or renewal | 2 years | $27\n\nAdvanced pharmacy technician license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $110\n\nIn-state pharmacy permit application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of permit | 2 years | $550\n\nMail order/out of state pharmacy permit application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of permit | 2 years | $2,200\n\nNuclear pharmacy permit application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial or renewal or reinstatement after expiration of permit | 2 years | $550\n\nCompounding pharmacy permit application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of permit | 2 years | $550\n\nSpecial pharmacy permit application processing and licensing | 60 days | $16\n\nManufacturer/Wholesaler distributor of prescription drugs permit application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $550\n\nLimited retail drug distributor application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $550\n\nOutsourcing facilities under RSA 318:51-c permit application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial or renewal | 2 years | $550\n\nReverse distributors, brokers, research organizations, drug/device distribution agent license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $550\n\nSource. #13125, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 10-23-20, EXPIRED: 4-21-21\n\nNew. #13265, INTERIM, eff 9-22-21, EXPIRED: 3-21-22\n\nNew. #13420, eff 8-8-22 (formerly Plc 1002.23); ss by #13703, eff 8-1-23 (formerly Plc 1002.35); ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
